# Web Surveys to Digital Movies: Technological Tools of the Trade.

**Authors:** Fetterman, David M.

## Abstract
Highlights some of the technological tools used by educational researchers today, focusing on data collection related tools such as Web surveys, digital photography, voice recognition and transcription, file sharing and virtual office, videoconferencing on the Internet, instantaneous chat and chat rooms, reporting and dissemination, and digital movies. (SM)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ653121

